<title>USA: M.G. Products says loses major customer.</title>
<headline>M.G. Products says loses major customer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.G. Products Inc said at its annual meeting that it will lose a major customer at the end of this month.</p>
<p>The company described the customer as &quot;significant&quot;, and said the customer's business represented less than 10 percent of 1996 sales revenue.</p>
<p>This revenue loss will further hamper the company's efforts to return to profitability, the company said.</p>
